
Lista meta: ['sum'] agħmel: {
	>> total := 0.
	innifsu kull: { :index :element
		total żid: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Lista ← 9 ; 8 ; 7.
Ħruġ ikteb: (a sum), linja-ġdida. 
>> a := Lista ← 1 ; 9.
Ħruġ ikteb: (a sum), linja-ġdida. 
>> a := Lista ← ['o'] ; 2.
Ħruġ ikteb: (a sum), linja-ġdida. 
Ħruġ ikteb: (Lista ġdid sum), linja-ġdida. 
